msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Implemented a custom `ServiceRegistrarProvider` using the "
"`@ServiceRegistrarType` and `@ServiceRegistrarAttribute` annotations."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Implemented a custom `ServiceRegistrar` with `registerServiceInstance` and "
"`deregisterServiceInstance` methods."
msgstr ""

